e link, and wearing a hat similar to Mario/Luigi with the color pink (#EE9CEB) and the letter K instead.\nShe has a lot of cute outfits and I don't mind which one you choose.\n\nIt will be used as a profile icon if that is acceptable.\nPlease and thank you again!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ej4iG2xgZ_zFq-Wl2XdQEW5w2wh_e3ud?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@fpsmoe/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/331e718f/uploads/origins/6e7132d6-cf3d-4fe5-bd04-4fb13fcecdc6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20788af9c2822b0049efb596acce272f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/331e718f/uploads/origins/6e7132d6-cf3d-4fe5-bd04-4fb13fcecdc6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20788af9c2822b0049efb596acce272f, https://si.imgix.net/331e718f/uploads/origins/6e7132d6-cf3d-4fe5-bd04-4fb13fcecdc6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca38b5eea77bf493336c152d3e72081c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/331e718f/uploads/origins/6e7132d6-cf3d-4fe5-bd04-4fb13fcecdc6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17d5a38e13d19c55c1dc2e8d551ef74f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello~. Your work is so cute!!!~\n\nI would like to have Fernet from 100% Orange in her base outfit and purple crown like in this picture.\n(https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/443283840744554499/1147933259062317086/latest.png)\nWith her expression being a smug and thinking. Could I have a transparent background copy as well?\n\nPlease and thank you~.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@fpsmoe/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bdb129c1/uploads/origins/74e58c4b-c205-4601-9ba8-62b85667ca4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6cac78bbff0d6cf85ba1df1b9e7dd75", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bdb129c1/uploads/origins/74e58c4b-c205-