uld like, I leave the pose and expression up to you!\n\nI will also be using these on my twitch and twitter if that is okay too! ^^\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1Jb3B61LjsL1FrdA1Ozw6FVc76SRtQRXd", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@fpsmoe/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ede0ef57/uploads/origins/2e8b4014-0fa4-44b9-9cc0-cd69ca15b0be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=def5318ae5350f1d94aa3ec5973b2cbf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ede0ef57/uploads/origins/2e8b4014-0fa4-44b9-9cc0-cd69ca15b0be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=def5318ae5350f1d94aa3ec5973b2cbf, https://si.imgix.net/ede0ef57/uploads/origins/2e8b4014-0fa4-44b9-9cc0-cd69ca15b0be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c064c43eeb398cfc3ec010560b47c86d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ede0ef57/uploads/origins/2e8b4014-0fa4-44b9-9cc0-cd69ca15b0be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e183dd1fdcde8c4a6f7ddbec535d9cda 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I really like your work. I'd appreciate a piece done of my VrChat avatar. The expression and pose can be whatever you want.\n\nReference Sheet:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/sUkX9aT\n\nThanks!!!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/sUkX9aT", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@fpsmoe/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/11941bad/uploads/origins/fd4a3be4-b772-4830-9d76-581804f52695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c353384e5601e1b30c52c3a308b6e3d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/11941bad/uploads/origins/fd4a3be4-b772-4830-9d76-581804f52695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c353384e5601e1b30c52c3a308b6e3d, https://si.imgix.net/11941bad/uploads/origins/fd4a3be4-b772-4830-9d76-581804f52695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccomp